How is a funeral arrangement handleled from first contact to burial?
Answer: The family calls our landline or comes in person.We write all details in a paper diary.We confirm the date ,then call burial society to verify membership.On the day ,driver and mortuary staff check the diary.Atfer burial we file the paprers in a boox.
What problems are experienced with the current paper diaries?
Answer: Big problems we sometimes lose the diary and have doble bookings because staff write at once.We cannot search old clients.If a family calls at night we cannot check prices.
Which issue causes the greatest operational bottleneck?
Answer:Phone calls ,we get alot of phone calls everyday asking "How much is a coffin" ?"Are you free on saturdays"?One person must sit and answer phones instead of helping families.
What features should bereaved families see on the mobile app?
Answer: They must see our service packages and prices.They must book a funeral online, check if their burial society is active,see address,directions,and contact us on whatsapp.No need to call at 2am.
What administrative tools do staff need on the web portal?
Answer: We need a dashboard to see all bookings.Calender for drivers and mortuary.We need to track payments and burial society premiums.We need to print invoices on daily reports.We need to add /edit staff accounts.
How are burial society policies and premium payments verified?
Answer: Right now we phone the burial society office and wait to 2 days for reply.Sometiomes they don't answer.We need the system to check status online automatically.
What daily schedule reports to drivers and mortuary staff need?
Answer: Every morning they need a list : Name of deceased,pickup time,pickup address,church,cemetery.They also need vehicle assigned and contact person ,Printed or on their phone.
What data privacy considerations apply to customer records?
Answer:Customer ID numbers,cause of death , and family contact details are private.Only admin and owner must see full details .Staff must login with password.We must comply with POPIA because it is sensitive information.

